 ],
 "deleted": [
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 7,
   "text": "Product analysts, data engineers and the privacy team all depend on the same answer to how far back a query can reach and who removes data once it is too old."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 11,
   "text": "The note covers the raw event tables in the events dataset, the daily rollup tables built from them, and the scratch schemas analysts create for ad hoc work."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 11,
   "text": "The finance schemas follow a seven-year retention rule set by the tax authority."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 11,
   "text": "The finance schemas are owned by the finance data team and appear here only so that readers know where the line falls."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 15,
   "text": "Every raw event table keeps 400 days of data, counted from the event date of each partition."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 15,
   "text": "On the first Sunday of each month, the retention steward opens a purge ticket that lists every partition older than 400 days."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 15,
   "text": "The owner of each table approves its part of the ticket, and the steward then runs the monthly purge against the approved partitions."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 17,
   "text": "The 400 days give analysts a full year of history plus a month of margin for late corrections."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 21,
   "text": "Daily rollup tables aggregate raw events by day, product and country, and hold counts and sums only."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 21,
   "text": "They are kept for 25 months and removed by the same monthly purge."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 23,
   "text": "Because raw tables hold more than a year, a year-over-year query can run straight against raw events at full detail."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 23,
   "text": "Rollups serve dashboards that need a longer view or faster answers."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 25,
   "text": "The legal team holds that pseudonymized identifiers still count as personal data."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 25,
   "text": "Raw event tables therefore fall under the erasure process described below."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 29,
   "text": "When a user asks for erasure, the privacy team files the request in the erasure queue."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 29,
   "text": "The retention steward adds each queued user to the next purge ticket, and the monthly purge deletes that user's rows from every raw event table."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 29,
   "text": "The law gives us 30 days, and a monthly cycle stays inside that limit as long as the purge runs on schedule."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 35,
   "text": "A backfill can rebuild raw-derived tables from any partition inside the 400-day window."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 35,
   "text": "Teams that change a metric definition usually reprocess the full window, which takes about two days on the shared cluster."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 37,
   "text": "Periods older than 400 days can be rebuilt only at rollup grain."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 41,
   "text": "The warehouse health dashboard shows, per raw table, the oldest partition present and the number of partitions waiting on the next purge ticket."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 43,
   "text": "A table whose oldest partition passes 430 days raises an alert to the retention steward."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 44,
   "text": "A purge ticket left unapproved for a week is escalated to the table owner's manager."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 45,
   "text": "The steward posts a summary of each monthly purge in the data platform channel."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 49,
