   "line": 53,
   "text": "Scratch schemas"
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 53,
   "text": "The analyst who created it"
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 53,
   "text": "30 days"
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 53,
   "text": "Monthly purge"
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 56,
   "text": "The retention steward is a rotating role held for one quarter by a data engineer from the platform team."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 56,
   "text": "The steward keeps the purge calendar and answers questions about what was removed."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 60,
   "text": "A table that needs raw rows beyond 400 days, for a legal hold or an audit, requires a written exception from the data governance lead."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/10-data-retention-in-an-analytics-warehouse/old.md",
   "line": 60,
   "text": "The steward leaves the excepted partitions off every purge ticket until the exception lapses."
  }
 ],
